textwrap (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate textwrap
(https://github.com/mgeisler/textwrap), version 0.16.2, together with the
column-minima search from the Rust crate smawk
(https://github.com/mgeisler/smawk), version 0.3.3, to Meadow. Its test cases
are generated from textwrap, and its code is translated from both crates'
source.

